VALUES (4793, 'tt0121932', NULL, 'Extreme Ghostbusters', 'Extreme Ghostbusters', 'tv', 1997, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7E3jimDtr5oNNM3NGf8MP8So3yp.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6M7CuNytVXL57OjWf3u9cu1HUb2.jpg', 'Based on the blockbuster films, this action-packed animated series starts a decade after the original Ghostbusters saved New York City from ghosts, goblins and ghouls. All the guys have left town, except Egon, now teaching a Paranormal Studies class at the local university. But Zuul, the all-powerful demon, has awakened from hibernation to wreak havoc on the unsuspecting masses. Desperate to recruit a new team, Egon and the plucky Janine turn to four of his teenage students: Kylie, a genius with an encyclopedic knowledge of the occult; Eduardo, a hip slacker with a crush on Kylie; Garrett, a wheelchair-bound athlete with a hot temper; and Roland, a “gentle giant” mechanical whiz. It''s only a matter of time before Egon, Janine, old pal Slimer and the “kids” band together to rid the city of the evildoers.', NULL, NULL, 11.417, 6.7, 0, 13.5125, '2026-10-19 04:56:39', '2026-10-19 04:56:39')
