VALUES (120, 'tt0120737', NULL, 'The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring', 'The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring', 'movie', 2001, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oom5QYQ2yQTMJIbnvbkBL9cHo6.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mWDdRXTivGE7aaY2vo1Ie0PfCX5.jpg', 'Young hobbit Frodo Baggins, after inheriting a mysterious ring from his uncle Bilbo, must leave his home in order to keep it from falling into the hands of its evil creator. Along the way, a fellowship is formed to protect the ringbearer and make sure that the ring arrives at its final destination: Mt. Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed.', NULL, NULL, 44.0875, 8.4, 0, 94.706, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-19 04:56:39')
