VALUES (22538, 'tt0446029', NULL, 'Scott Pilgrim vs. the World', 'Scott Pilgrim vs. the World', 'movie', 2010, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5IoYeudx9XBEfwNL0fHvSckLBz.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6R9nT6m8wmzayV5XOQq3TRA6yZw.jpg', 'As bass guitarist for a garage-rock band, Scott Pilgrim has never had trouble getting a girlfriend; usually, the problem is getting rid of them. But when Ramona Flowers skates into his heart, he finds she has the most troublesome baggage of all: an army of ex-boyfriends who will stop at nothing to eliminate him from her list of suitors.', NULL, NULL, 12.4636, 7.486, 0, 5.61851923076923114e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-19 04:56:39')
